All team members need to add themselves to the credits through the [Google Form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf4j16ixH8jg5zsd-afglBbVQJYVJJn8vCWWMyS-wJSMaNlDg/viewform?usp=sharing&ouid=117941482602412729471), even if you have not contributed yet. Make sure you only submit one form, & that you keep updating the same form if you need to change any information. You can include the specific work that you have done, but that will only be seen internally.

> Note: We treat all contributors **equally**

